      "created_at": "2024-10-25T14:26:38.337Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc\" title=\"Arcane Wonders box\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc_2_587x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Arcane Wonders box\" data-base62-sha1=\"480IrQxnPHEsrpedCNmdbKMpwrW\" width=\"587\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc_2_587x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc_2_880x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1cf0896cb40080264f69588aca54dcbf2f9126fc_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Arcane Wonders box</span><span class=\"informations\">1000×851 68.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nSo I went down to check the mail today because I had a package.</p>\n<p>Was it my family’s medical supplies that typically come in this big a box? No, it was the <em>board game</em> I kickstarted.</p>\n<p>My mom’s walker for scale, I guess? Jesus this thing is huge. It’s as heavy as it is big, too.</p>\n<p>Ironically I can’t give you an unboxing because we’re currently having construction done, so my shelves are currently taken up by all the stuff that would normally be on the moved furniture, so I have nowhere to put the contents of this box.</p>",
